# CODEOWNERS — Pumni Web OS
#
# GitHub auto-requests review from the owners of any path touched by a PR.
# This protects the AI-context layer (instruction + recipe + enforcement planes)
# from silent drift, and the security boundary from accidental weakening.
#
# Keep owners in sync with the human ownership notes in
# `docs/ai/context-maintenance.md`. When more contributors arrive, replace the
# single handle below with team handles (@pumni/<team>) or per-area owners.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# --- Security boundary (P0): never drift silently ---
# Supabase migrations carry RLS, policies, grants — the real data boundary.
/.github/workflows/                            @pumz
/supabase/migrations/                          @pumz

# --- Instruction plane: AI reads these to know the rules ---
/AGENTS.md                                     @pumz
/apps/web/AGENTS.md                            @pumz
/packages/*/AGENTS.md                          @pumz
/.claude/rules/                                @pumz
/.github/copilot-instructions.md               @pumz
/CLAUDE.md                                     @pumz
/CODEX.md                                      @pumz
/GEMINI.md                                     @pumz
/llms.txt                                      @pumz
/.aiignore                                     @pumz
/docs/ai/                                      @pumz
/docs/architecture/                            @pumz
/docs/conventions/                             @pumz
/docs/adr/                                     @pumz

# --- Recipe plane: reusable procedures + regression scenarios ---
/.agents/skills/                               @pumz
/.agents/workflows/                            @pumz
/.agents/evals/                                @pumz

# --- Enforcement plane: deterministic gates ---
/scripts/ai-context.manifest.json              @pumz
/scripts/check-ai-context.mjs                  @pumz
/scripts/check-review-gate-rules.mjs           @pumz
/scripts/review-gate-rules.mjs                 @pumz
/scripts/check-secrets.mjs                     @pumz
/scripts/run-ai-evals.mjs                      @pumz
/scripts/sync-project-graph.mjs                @pumz
/scripts/frontmatter.mjs                       @pumz
